- `name` in `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`;
- every `hakanserce-plugins` in `README.md` (`/plugin install atm@…`, `/plugin marketplace update …`, the plugin cache path) and in docs that tell users what to run; history (CHANGELOG entries) stays;
